From 6a08ed07b8d45df1bf2291e9916664c53247ab0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mustafa Ali <quic_mustali@quicinc.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Mar 2025 11:16:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad: Add meson option to build all
 plugins

- Default value is to build all plugins
- If reduced set of plugins is selected, then only are build:
    gst-libs/gst/wayland
    ext/wayland

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Qualcomm specific]

Signed-off-by: Mustafa Ali <quic_mustali@quicinc.com>
---
